# Topics: fcpx/<raw|event>/<service>/... (see the logger package README)
#
# One account per service, named after its LOG_SERVICE: it can only publish under its own name.
# Explicit rules, not `pattern write fcpx/raw/%u/#`: a pattern applies to every account, the ESP32 included.
# A new service needs its own block here, and an account (mosquitto/passwd.sh <service>).

user dataapi
topic write fcpx/raw/dataapi/#
topic write fcpx/event/dataapi/#

user eventapi
topic write fcpx/raw/eventapi/#
topic write fcpx/event/eventapi/#

user authapi
topic write fcpx/raw/authapi/#
topic write fcpx/event/authapi/#

user paddlesync
topic write fcpx/raw/paddlesync/#
topic write fcpx/event/paddlesync/#

# The ESP32: read only
user esp32
topic read fcpx/#
